    "id": "starstone:network/first-lamp",
    "text": "First lamp: craft a Starstone Generator and Starstone Lamp. Place the generator on the floor, then use the lamp on one of its faces. A new generator starts on, so the lamp lights. Use the generator to switch the lamp off and on. No redstone input or cable is needed for this first setup."
